[INFO] 09-22 10:46:15 run_experiments.py:98] *   $R$ is the ideal gas constant ($8.314 \text{ J/(mol·K)}$).
[INFO] 09-22 10:46:15 run_experiments.py:98] *   $T$ is the absolute temperature in Kelvin.
[INFO] 09-22 10:46:15 run_experiments.py:98] *   $\pi$ is the mathematical constant (approximately $3.14159$).
[INFO] 09-22 10:46:15 run_experiments.py:98] *   $M$ is the molar mass of the gas in kg/mol.
