[INFO] 09-22 10:46:15 run_experiments.py:98] *   **Conceptual Traps**: Confusing mean speed with root-mean-square speed ($v_{rms} = \sqrt{\frac{3RT}{M}}$) or most probable speed ($v_{mp} = \sqrt{\frac{2RT}{M}}$). The question explicitly asks for "mean molecular speed".
[INFO] 09-22 10:46:15 run_experiments.py:98] *   **Calculation Traps**:
