[INFO] 09-22 12:48:24 run_experiments.py:98] (a) Find all possible values ​​of  $N$ .
[INFO] 09-22 12:48:24 run_experiments.py:98] (b) Find all possible values ​​of  $N$  in the case where, after the increase, the average of the promoted had become  $79$  and that of non-promoted  $47$ .
