[INFO] 09-22 15:07:01 run_experiments.py:98] - Conceptual: Confusing “mean (average) speed” with RMS speed v_rms = sqrt(3RT/M) or most-probable speed v_p = sqrt(2RT/M). Also confusing H (1.008 g/mol) with H2 (2.016 g/mol).
[INFO] 09-22 15:07:01 run_experiments.py:98] - Calculation: Unit errors when converting g/mol to kg/mol; mixing k_B with R and m with M; omitting π in the mean-speed formula; using inappropriate significant figures.
