[INFO] 09-22 15:07:01 run_experiments.py:98] - Non-relativistic Doppler shift for energy: for velocities much less than c, the fractional energy shift is ΔE/E0 ≈ v_los/c, where v_los is the component of the emitter’s velocity along the line of sight.
